      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST LIKE LISA (5) was much better last time out when sent forward and fighting on gamely to just miss the bob at Naracoorte. No tougher this time, so if she holds her form she can take this out. NANKEEN (4) comes through the same race where he turned in a better effort to finish midfield. Should be hitting his straps now fourth-up and rates one of the main chances. EMMOOKI MAGIC (6) showed good early speed over 1050m at Balaklava last time and went on to salute by 4 lengths. Is drawn to advantage and warrants plenty of respect off that. TANNA (3) did little at Balaklava last start, a less impressive effort than his fourth at Mildura the run before. Best figures measure up nicely. Can give another go.",
